# Anchored to the real runtime upload dir (LocalDiskStorage's default, resolved relative to
# apps/api's own cwd) — NOT a bare/`**/`-globbed `uploads` pattern. That form matches ANY
# directory named "uploads" at any depth, including the real source module
# apps/api/src/uploads/ (UploadsModule/UploadsController/UploadsService) — which broke the Railway
# Docker build with "Cannot find module './uploads/uploads.module'" the moment that module was
# added, the same class of bug .gitignore's bare `storage/`/`uploads/` patterns already caused
# twice before (see DECISIONS.md).
apps/api/uploads
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
apps/api/*.tsbuildinfo
